WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.734 --> 00:00:13.124
Mrs. Rice: See, I told you.

2
00:00:13.125 --> 00:00:15.879
I told you there was a giant in there.

3
00:00:15.880 --> 00:00:18.408
Mr. Joseph: Brad, open this door!

4
00:00:18.409 --> 00:00:23.459
Mrs. Rice: We should knock the door down!

5
00:00:23.460 --> 00:00:25.652
Dave: That's amazing!

6
00:00:25.653 --> 00:00:28.202
Chuck: That's incredible!

7
00:00:28.203 --> 00:00:31.407
Tina: I can't believe it.

8
00:00:31.408 --> 00:00:34.240
Danny: I can't believe it either.

9
00:00:34.241 --> 00:00:39.309
I'm back to normal. Hurray!

10
00:00:39.310 --> 00:00:40.948
Bello: Good work, Brad.

11
00:00:40.949 --> 00:00:43.977
Brad: Wow! It actually worked.

12
00:00:43.978 --> 00:00:46.259
Dave: Brad, you're a genius!

13
00:00:46.260 --> 00:00:49.438
Mr. Joseph: Bradley, open this door!

14
00:00:49.439 --> 00:00:50.922
Tina: Who is that?

15
00:00:50.923 --> 00:00:53.647
Brad: Oh no, it's my dad!

16
00:00:53.648 --> 00:00:56.266
Chuck: He sounds angry.

17
00:00:56.268 --> 00:01:01.542
Brad: He is! He only calls me Bradley when he's mad.

18
00:01:01.543 --> 00:01:04.513
Mr. Joseph: This is ridiculous.

19
00:01:04.514 --> 00:01:06.515
Come on, let's go.

20
00:01:06.516 --> 00:01:09.747
Mrs. Rice: You can't give up.

21
00:01:09.748 --> 00:01:11.107
Mr. Joseph: I'm not giving up.

22
00:01:11.108 --> 00:01:13.065
I'm going to get the key.

23
00:01:13.066 --> 00:01:16.602
Mrs. Rice: Wait for me!

24
00:01:16.603 --> 00:01:18.961
Danny: I don't hear him knocking anymore.

25
00:01:18.962 --> 00:01:20.641
Tina: Is he gone?

26
00:01:20.642 --> 00:01:22.818
Chuck: Someone should check.

27
00:01:22.819 --> 00:01:29.720
Brad: I'll go.

28
00:01:29.721 --> 00:01:31.741
Brad: He's gone.

29
00:01:31.742 --> 00:01:33.380
Bello: Did you see anyone?

30
00:01:33.381 --> 00:01:34.510
Brad: Nope.

31
00:01:34.511 --> 00:01:37.888
Tina: So we've got a few minutes to figure something out.

32
00:01:37.889 --> 00:01:41.275
Danny: You have to use the shrink-gun again, quickly.

33
00:01:41.276 --> 00:01:44.125
Tina: Danny's right. Who's next?

34
00:01:44.126 --> 00:01:46.566
Dave: We should unshrink Brad first.

35
00:01:46.567 --> 00:01:48.343
Bello: We don't have time.

36
00:01:48.344 --> 00:01:50.744
We should do everyone together.

37
00:01:50.745 --> 00:01:52.334
Danny: Hop on, everybody!

38
00:01:52.335 --> 00:01:55.029
Chuck: Let's go!

39
00:01:55.030 --> 00:01:59.537
Danny: There. Brad, give me the shrink-gun.

40
00:01:59.538 --> 00:02:03.003
Brad: Here you go.

41
00:02:03.004 --> 00:02:05.146
Tina: Danny, what's the matter?

42
00:02:05.147 --> 00:02:07.070
Danny: It's too small for me.

43
00:02:07.071 --> 00:02:09.737
I can't pull the trigger.

44
00:02:09.739 --> 00:02:16.387
Danny: Hang on just a minute.

45
00:02:16.388 --> 00:02:17.978
Dave: What's he doing?

46
00:02:17.979 --> 00:02:23.796
Brad: I don't know, but he better hurry.

47
00:02:23.797 --> 00:02:26.469
Danny: Hold onto the shrink-gun, Brad.

48
00:02:26.470 --> 00:02:31.239
Danny: Okay, now tie the thread around the trigger of the shrink-gun.

49
00:02:31.240 --> 00:02:32.863
Bello: Here you go.

50
00:02:32.864 --> 00:02:35.858
Brad: Thanks.

51
00:02:35.859 --> 00:02:39.656
Danny: Okay, now stick the shrink-gun into the nano-putty.

52
00:02:39.657 --> 00:02:42.329
Danny: Make sure it is pointing at you.

53
00:02:42.330 --> 00:02:46.651
Tina: Great idea, Danny.

54
00:02:46.652 --> 00:02:49.636
Bello: We're ready!

55
00:02:49.637 --> 00:02:57.088
Danny: One, two, three . . .
